## Prompt 模板

```
[STYLE]: rough sketch storyboard, unfinished pencil linework, visible
construction lines, loose sketchy scribble strokes, flat single-tone
rendering, each character marked by one flat accent color only, minimal
abstract facial marks, plain silhouette forms for clothing and hair

[GRID]: {N} panels, {ROWS} rows x {COLS} cols, thin black gutter lines
between panels, panel number labeled top-left corner of each panel (1-{N}),
reading order left-to-right top-to-bottom, each panel content contained
strictly within its own gutter border

[CHARACTER COLOR KEY]: {CHAR_A} = red outline, {CHAR_B} = blue outline,
{CHAR_C} = green outline (按角色數量調整，唔重複用色)

[PANEL 1]: {shot size} shot, {character color tag} {action/blocking description},
{camera movement if any} — 構圖角度/景框要與相鄰 panel 明顯不同
[PANEL 2]: {shot size} shot, {character color tag} {action/blocking description},
{camera movement if any}
...
[PANEL N]: ...

[STYLE CONSISTENCY]: maintain flat single-tone rendering and minimal
abstract facial marks across all panels, keep clear visual separation
between panels, preserve consistent loose sketch style throughout
```

---

## Claude 執行時嘅工作流程

當用戶提供一場戲嘅 shot list / 動作描述時：

1. 判斷呢場戲有幾多個 shot → 決定分幾個 prompt（每個 prompt 上限 12 panel）
2. 將每個 shot 濃縮做一句 panel 描述（shot size + action + camera，唔加角色細節）
3. 套用上面模板，輸出完整 prompt（純文字，唔使 `{KEY}` tag）
4. 如果用戶要求，同時生成對應嘅 job `.json`（`quality: low`, 無 `selected` array，
   因為冇 reference image 需要）

---

## 適用範圍 / 唔適用場景

**適用：**
- 睇成場戲鏡頭順序、走位、構圖節奏
- 快速跟導演/團隊過版
- Draft-cheap 階段，用嚟決定會唔會入下一步（逐格精做）

**唔適用：**
- 需要角色一致性判斷（用返逐格 + identity lock 做法）
- 最終 reference image 或要俾模型學嘅 pose/depth map
- 需要精細五官/服裝細節核對嘅場合